xeno-facehugger-impregnate-others = { CAPITALIZE(THE($hugger)) } falls limp after violating { THE($target) }'s face!
xeno-facehugger-sterile-self = { CAPITALIZE(THE($hugger)) } violates your face!
xeno-facehugger-sterile-others = { CAPITALIZE(THE($hugger)) } violates { THE($target) }'s face!
xeno-facehugger-die = { CAPITALIZE(THE($hugger)) } curls up into a ball!

